{
  "info": {
    "name": "Gestão de Colaboradores e Unidades API",
    "description": "Collection da API .NET 8 (Sistema de Gestão de Colaboradores e Unidades).\n\nComo usar:\n1. Suba o PostgreSQL (docker compose up) e rode a API.\n2. Execute a requisição **Auth > Login**. O script da aba Tests captura o token automaticamente e o grava na variável {{token}}.\n3. Todas as demais rotas já usam Bearer {{token}} herdado da collection. Basta disparar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:5080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Master)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Toque de Sênior: injeta o token automaticamente na variável {{token}}.",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token capturado e salvo em {{token}}.');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Resposta sem campo token.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"master\",\n  \"senha\": \"Master@123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
      "item": [
